Phase: Brand Strategy Hub Project Import/Export Full Fidelity Feature
Status: Verified & Completed
Date: 2026-10-29
App: Brand Strategy Hub
Author: vlad@bluebeeweb.com

Summary of Changes:
- schemas.py:
  * Added ExportBrandProjectParams, ExportBrandProjectResult
  * Added ImportBrandProjectParams, ImportBrandProjectResult
- main.py:
  * Backend action export_brand_project:
    - Extracts brand_profiles document
    - Extracts and packages all 13 related collections with 100% full fidelity:
      1. target_segments (by brand_profile_id)
      2. competitors (by brand_profile_id)
      3. swot_results (by brand_profile_id)
      4. gap_analyses (by brand_profile_id)
      5. market_research_results (by brand_profile_id)
      6. visual_brand_workspaces (by brand_profile_id)
      7. visual_profiles (by brand_profile_id)
      8. visual_brand_memberships (by workspace_id)
      9. visual_brand_audit_events (by workspace_id)
      10. visual_brand_audit_incidents (by workspace_id)
      11. visual_brand_evidence_transitions (by workspace_id)
      12. visual_brand_assets (by workspace_id)
      13. connected_sites (by brand_profile_id)
    - Metadata: version 1, exported_at timestamp, schema versioning
  * Backend action import_brand_project:
    - Re-establishes workspace and profile hierarchy
    - Deterministic ID mapping (brand_profile_id, workspace_id, sub-entity IDs)
    - Re-binds visual_brand_workspaces, visual_profiles, and memberships
    - Restores all target segments, competitors, SWOT, gap analyses, market research, audit events, assets, and connections
    - Full support for multi-tenant / multi-account import with current tenant scoping
  * UI in _brand_detail_panel:
    - Added "Export Project" button triggering JSON download / export modal
    - Added "Import Project" button with modal JSON file / text upload and instant restoration
- tests/test_export_import.py:
  * Unit and integration test suite:
    - test_panel_has_export_and_import: verifies export & import buttons are rendered in the UI
    - test_export_import_full: verifies 100% full roundtrip import/export fidelity across all 14 collections
- backups/:
  * backups/main.py.bak
  * backups/schemas.py.bak
